    "description": "We're proud to introduce the brand-new ROMANTIC JOURNEY to you. With romantic journey, not only can you enjoy the charming backgrounds and beautiful themes that keep you feel relaxed, but also have several cute girls accompany you all the time. Jump right into the game to find out now!\r\n\r\nWelcome to the gentlemen\u2019s club and have some fun with Solitaire Classic casual games. It brings you with fun, realistic and challenging Solitaire classic gameplay you know. You can enjoy a beautiful, modern design, and easy-to-read hearts cards game experience. Meanwhile, Facebook game is also available!\r\n\r\nTest your skills and patience with our solitaire card games! Train your brain, play the Solitaire card game and wander in the solitaire world.\r\n\r\nSharpen your mind and play the ORIGINAL Free solitaire card game on Google Play!\r\n\r\n\u2660 Solitaire, also known as Patience, is the most addictive game and enjoyed by millions of card game players in the solitaire world with the strategy of 3 Card (3 Pass) Solitaire and 1 Card (1 Pass) Solitaire. \r\n\r\n\u2660 Try our best solitaire card app, which is easy and addictive, just like the mouse game of  Windows Solitaire\u2122. This is a wonderful solitaire play experience! Play different modes: Draw 1 or Draw 3 whether in spring, summer, fall, winter.\r\n\r\n\u2660 Are you bored with Solitaire apps that always seem to have the same rough gameplay and tired of in-app purchase games? Try this genuine version of Free Solitaire collection App. This Solitaire has better gameplay than any other Solitaire on the market, including Microsoft solitaire. Free Classic Solitaire is easy to download on your phone or tablet so that you can play it anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\n== Basic Features ==      \r\n\u2022 Customizable cards and radiant backgrounds offer a unique solitaire experience\r\n\u2022 Train your brain and patience in Draw-1 and Draw-3 card solitaire game modes                                                                 \r\n\u2022 Enjoy our easy tap or drag controls\r\n\u2022 Five stars certified\r\n\u2022 Single player mode\r\n\u2022 Offline mode\r\n\u2022 Classic Solitaire gameplay\r\n\u2022 Unlimited free hints and undos\r\n\u2022 Left-handed Mode available \r\n\u2022 Selection from Classic or Vegas Scoring\r\n\u2022 Custom classic card decks and backgrounds\r\n\u2022 Daily Challenges and beautiful HD graphics\r\n\u2022 Additional game modes: 100% winnable deals and Vegas solitaire scoring\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea9Now! Play popular classic card games on Google Play for free, without stress and distraction. There's no other card game like it!",
